{
  "id": "sonic-pi-drums",
  "name": "Sonic Pi Drums & Percussion",
  "tagline": "Acoustic, electronic and tabla one-shots from Sonic Pi's CC0 library",
  "description": "The drum and percussion part of the sample library that ships with Sonic Pi: an acoustic kit (kicks, snares, hats, cymbals and toms at two dynamics), 15 kicks, 22 hats, 4 snares, 25 electronic blips and hits, finger snaps and 26 tabla strokes. Collected from freesound.org and donated sounds, all dedicated to the public domain (CC0); the bundled README.md links every original. Four kits: Acoustic, Electro, Kick & Hat Lab (8 kicks on bank A, 8 hats on bank B) and Tabla.",
